---
layout: base.njk
title: Articles
permalink: /articles/
---
{% from "visual.njk" import visual %}
<section class="intro">
  <h1>Articles</h1>
  <p>Long-form, citable pieces that develop the ideas tested in posts. Each one has a citation block, and a DOI once archived.</p>
</section>

{% if collections.articles.length %}
<ol class="post-list">
  {% for a in collections.articles %}
  <li>
    <a class="post-card" href="{{ a.url }}">
      {% if a.data.visual %}<div class="thumb">{{ visual(a) | safe }}</div>{% endif %}
      <div>
        <p class="meta"><time datetime="{{ a.date | isoDate }}">{{ a.date | readableDate }}</time>{% if a.data.pillar %} · {{ a.data.pillar }}{% endif %}{% if a.data.draft %} · <span class="badge">Draft</span>{% endif %}</p>
        <h2>{{ a.data.title }}</h2>
        {% if a.data.description %}<p>{{ a.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </a>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>
{% else %}
<p class="empty">No articles yet.</p>
{% endif %}
